(7094214, 1080419, 138253, '<td valign="top">don''t worry about that creepy guy in the tree. he''s totally not trying to take pictures of you.<br/> <br/>i will say though, the shirt is a bit overexposed and glaringly white, losing any detail, i think you''ll lose some points for that, and the angle feels off. posing on an angle is fine, but just tilting the camera puts a lot of people''s senses over the edge and they vote on the image with a ''wrong'' feeling to it.</td>', 'don''t worry about that creepy guy in the tree. he''s totally not trying to take pictures of you. i will say though, the shirt is a bit overexposed and glaringly white, losing any detail, i think you''ll lose some points for that, and the angle feels off. posing on an angle is fine, but just tilting the camera puts a lot of people''s senses over the edge and they vote on the image with a ''wrong'' feeling to it.', '2013-08-28 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7094216, 1080833, 138253, '<td valign="top">it''s a good thing i didn''t use the picture of me wearing the same dress...that just would''ve been awkward.<br/> <br/> <br/>i do like the juxtaposition between the birds flying above and the "wings" on the dress while you remain solidly on the ground, but the top is a bit dark and it''s easy to lose the bird when the eye is drawn to the bright horizon</td>', 'it''s a good thing i didn''t use the picture of me wearing the same dress...that just would''ve been awkward.  i do like the juxtaposition between the birds flying above and the "wings" on the dress while you remain solidly on the ground, but the top is a bit dark and it''s easy to lose the bird when the eye is drawn to the bright horizon', '2013-08-28 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
