(7097319, 1080965, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the gentleness of this.</td>', 'I love the gentleness of this.', '2013-09-03 00:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097321, 1080765, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fun!!  Very artistic, too - I''d have no idea how to pull this off.</td>', 'Very fun!!  Very artistic, too - I''d have no idea how to pull this off.', '2013-09-03 00:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097322, 1080712, 30982, '<td valign="top">So lovely!  I''d recognize those curls anywhere.... :-)</td>', 'So lovely!  I''d recognize those curls anywhere.... :-)', '2013-09-03 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097323, 1080777, 30982, '<td valign="top">I spy, with my little eye.... Love the screen overlay, too.</td>', 'I spy, with my little eye.... Love the screen overlay, too.', '2013-09-03 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097324, 1080656, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot!  Though I''m never brave enough to try this.  Lovely path.</td>', 'My kind of shot!  Though I''m never brave enough to try this.  Lovely path.', '2013-09-03 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097325, 1080845, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing - it''s fun to try to determine where the symmetry has been created and where it has been left alone.  Excellent photoshop work!</td>', 'Quite intriguing - it''s fun to try to determine where the symmetry has been created and where it has been left alone.  Excellent photoshop work!', '2013-09-03 00:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097326, 1080833, 30982, '<td valign="top">Creative and dramatic!</td>', 'Creative and dramatic!', '2013-09-03 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097327, 1080883, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2013-09-03 00:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097344, 1080860, 15511, '<td valign="top">... b, b, but you cut off your chin!</td>', '... b, b, but you cut off your chin!', '2013-09-03 01:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097350, 1080392, 62249, '<td valign="top">The editing of the eyes into the fingers is kinda cool albeit slightly disturbing. But pretty well done. Maybe try a square crop in closer to your head to get rid of extraneous amount of arms and eliminate the distracting shadows on the wall.</td>', 'The editing of the eyes into the fingers is kinda cool albeit slightly disturbing. But pretty well done. Maybe try a square crop in closer to your head to get rid of extraneous amount of arms and eliminate the distracting shadows on the wall.', '2013-09-03 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097352, 1080899, 62249, '<td valign="top">Check your white balance. Your skin in the right half of the image looks greenish.</td>', 'Check your white balance. Your skin in the right half of the image looks greenish.', '2013-09-03 02:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097353, 1080967, 62249, '<td valign="top">Having yourself crawl out of the camera is a good idea and well rendered. Having yourself again in the background is distracting.</td>', 'Having yourself crawl out of the camera is a good idea and well rendered. Having yourself again in the background is distracting.', '2013-09-03 02:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097354, 1080712, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love the originality of this one. Makes me chuckle.</td>', 'Love the originality of this one. Makes me chuckle.', '2013-09-03 02:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097358, 1080921, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cool technique. I like it.</td>', 'Cool technique. I like it.', '2013-09-03 02:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097371, 1080870, 60173, '<td valign="top">So weird... my grandmother just sent me an email with a bunch of photos, and there was one in there almost exactly like this. I''m not sure how I feel about that, but I suppose you''re lucky I''m not voting.  :)</td>', 'So weird... my grandmother just sent me an email with a bunch of photos, and there was one in there almost exactly like this. I''m not sure how I feel about that, but I suppose you''re lucky I''m not voting.  :)', '2013-09-03 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097484, 1080966, 138253, '<td valign="top">The standing people are well lit and look decently edited together, but the background and person sitting look inconsistent compared to the others in the scene. The skin tone is more brown/tan than the reddish tint in the standing, and the lighting is overly dull in comparison.<br/>the shadow on the base of the chair also looks to awkward on the floor.<br/> <br/>good idea in the internal conflict, but a few things do take away from the image overall.</td>', 'The standing people are well lit and look decently edited together, but the background and person sitting look inconsistent compared to the others in the scene. The skin tone is more brown/tan than the reddish tint in the standing, and the lighting is overly dull in comparison.the shadow on the base of the chair also looks to awkward on the floor. good idea in the internal conflict, but a few things do take away from the image overall.', '2013-09-03 12:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097485, 1080675, 138253, '<td valign="top">given the pun in the title, and the fact that a large percentage of the hair is also ''washed out'', it lessens the effectiveness of the title<br/>overall well done, but a different title could have changed the perspective enough. (eg: "new shampoo so strong it even washes you out")</td>', 'given the pun in the title, and the fact that a large percentage of the hair is also ''washed out'', it lessens the effectiveness of the titleoverall well done, but a different title could have changed the perspective enough. (eg: "new shampoo so strong it even washes you out")', '2013-09-03 12:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097486, 1080526, 138253, '<td valign="top">great use of shadow here :)</td>', 'great use of shadow here :)', '2013-09-03 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097487, 1080819, 138253, '<td valign="top">very moving</td>', 'very moving', '2013-09-03 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097489, 1080579, 138253, '<td valign="top">decent job on a good concept, though layering with a second image identical to the first would give the rock formation above the shirt a proper look and not look as if it has a blurred shadow over it.</td>', 'decent job on a good concept, though layering with a second image identical to the first would give the rock formation above the shirt a proper look and not look as if it has a blurred shadow over it.', '2013-09-03 12:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097490, 1080957, 138253, '<td valign="top">well executed</td>', 'well executed', '2013-09-03 12:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097491, 1080943, 138253, '<td valign="top">looks too superimposed to be a realistic scene, detracts in my opinion</td>', 'looks too superimposed to be a realistic scene, detracts in my opinion', '2013-09-03 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097492, 1080984, 138253, '<td valign="top">while well put together, this just does not seem as photographic as "digital artwork", and that seems to be very common in this challenge.<br/>it''s great to show the expression of who you are, but doesn''t fit within my thoughts on the expert editing set of keeping it photographic in nature (though this is certainly a photograph IN nature) :)<br/>still a 6 though</td>', 'while well put together, this just does not seem as photographic as "digital artwork", and that seems to be very common in this challenge.it''s great to show the expression of who you are, but doesn''t fit within my thoughts on the expert editing set of keeping it photographic in nature (though this is certainly a photograph IN nature) :)still a 6 though', '2013-09-03 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097495, 1080712, 138253, '<td valign="top">does not seem photographic in nature, as much as a drawing with some teeth and a bit of neck added in for texture.</td>', 'does not seem photographic in nature, as much as a drawing with some teeth and a bit of neck added in for texture.', '2013-09-03 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097498, 1080641, 138253, '<td valign="top">does not seem photographic in nature enough to justify in my thoughts on the take on the definition in the expert ruleset. also looks like a large brush was used in the "undo" selection and close attention was not paid in ensuring that only the properly selected areas were "undone" from this picture.</td>', 'does not seem photographic in nature enough to justify in my thoughts on the take on the definition in the expert ruleset. also looks like a large brush was used in the "undo" selection and close attention was not paid in ensuring that only the properly selected areas were "undone" from this picture.', '2013-09-03 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097504, 1080921, 138253, '<td valign="top">does not seem photographic in nature to me, as per the expert editing ruleset. this looks like a picture of a painting on canvas.</td>', 'does not seem photographic in nature to me, as per the expert editing ruleset. this looks like a picture of a painting on canvas.', '2013-09-03 12:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
