(7098149, 1080777, 113591, '<td valign="top">Got scarier each time I looked at it.<br/>Wanted to say Hitchcock-movie-ish, but I googled it, and saw that the actual posters never had such a scary close-up image. <br/>His own portraits, though, were often on this type of angle.<br/> <br/>Never get the grandchildren to sleep over again, if you look at them like that.</td>', 'Got scarier each time I looked at it.Wanted to say Hitchcock-movie-ish, but I googled it, and saw that the actual posters never had such a scary close-up image. His own portraits, though, were often on this type of angle. Never get the grandchildren to sleep over again, if you look at them like that.', '2013-09-04 11:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
